{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">消防聯同警方在屯門搗破非法加油站，檢獲約4,100公升柴油，市值約15萬元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">非法加油站位於順達街，行動中發現油車及大批入油工具，並截查一名懷疑涉案女子。今次檢獲的柴油可供注滿約65輛輕型貨車的油缸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.OIL-1800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FNxXj1ISs71791551716.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.OIL-1800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">消防處呼籲市民切勿光顧非法加油站。如發現懷疑非法燃油轉注活動，可向消防處作出舉報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T14:18:59.899439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}